---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="About — RomeSoMuch"
  description="Rome told the way a local would tell it, by the community that lives here."
>
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap"><p class="crumb">Home / About</p><h1>Who we are</h1>
      <p class="lede">Rome without filters, one experience at a time.</p></div>
  </section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="article">
      <p>
        RomeSoMuch was born in 2023 from a simple idea: let people experience Rome the way Romans
        actually live it. Today we are the city's largest community, with over 1.5 million people
        following us across social media to discover the Eternal City through our eyes.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our mission is to tell Rome's story like a local would — not the usual postcard stops, but
        the real places, the right pace, the little details that make the difference between visiting
        a city and truly living it. Our goal is to introduce people to the best spots — from hidden
        trattorias down side streets to rooftops with the best views in town — and to show what to do
        in Rome in every season, whether it's a summer evening by the Tiber or a winter Sunday spent
        between a museum and a hot chocolate.
      </p>
      <p>
        We don't just tell Rome's story — we bring it to life. We create exclusive experiences of our
        own and partner with the best tour operators and providers in the city to give our community
        unforgettable moments, curated down to the last detail.
      </p>
      <p>
        That's RomeSoMuch: a community, a guide, and an invitation to discover Rome without filters,
        one experience at a time.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:28px">
        <a class="btn" href="/experiences/all/">Browse everything</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
